1321
02:12:19.866 --> 02:12:26.866
And Lord, I also want to ask you through your Holy Spirit to make me aware of the missions you have for me.

1322
02:12:27.866 --> 02:12:31.866
If you want this too, agree with my prayer.

1323
02:12:32.866 --> 02:12:34.866
Lord, what do you want from me?

1324
02:12:35.866 --> 02:12:37.866
Lord, what tasks do you have for me?

1325
02:12:37.866 --> 02:12:40.866
Big overarching tasks, but also individual tasks.

1326
02:12:41.866 --> 02:12:49.866
Think of Philip, who was instantly asked by the Holy Spirit, you must bring someone to repentance now.

1327
02:12:50.866 --> 02:12:54.866
Lord, everyone close your eyes as you pray this for yourself.

1328
02:12:54.866 --> 02:13:03.866
Lord, make my radio frequency stronger, so I can also pick up those missions.

1329
02:13:04.866 --> 02:13:08.866
That if you have it for me, at a certain moment, very, very suddenly.

1330
02:13:09.866 --> 02:13:13.866
Lord, that you have a task for me to bring someone the gospel.

1331
02:13:14.866 --> 02:13:15.866
Or to give someone something.

1332
02:13:16.866 --> 02:13:19.866
Or to be the kingdom of God, in whatever way.

1333
02:13:20.866 --> 02:13:22.866
Lord, I want to hear your voice.

1334
02:13:23.866 --> 02:13:26.866
Can you say it in five seconds in your own words? I want to hear your voice.

1335
02:13:27.866 --> 02:13:32.866
I want to hear your voice. Speak to me, Lord. Use me.

1336
02:13:33.866 --> 02:13:37.866
Who shall we send then? Here I am, Lord. Send me. Hallelujah.

1337
02:13:38.866 --> 02:13:41.866
Lord, I want to pray for Jeroen Elfrink, our brother in Christ.

1338
02:13:42.866 --> 02:13:46.866
Lord, we want to bless him with a bus for his work.

1339
02:13:46.866 --> 02:13:50.866
Protect him at this moment, while he is on missions now.

1340
02:13:51.866 --> 02:13:54.866
We love him. We bless him in the name of King Jesus.

1341
02:13:55.866 --> 02:13:57.866
And we all say amen. Amen, amen.

1342
02:13:58.866 --> 02:13:59.866
Thank you all very much.

1343
02:14:01.866 --> 02:14:02.866
For cash?

1344
02:14:03.866 --> 02:14:04.866
For missions.

1345
02:14:05.866 --> 02:14:07.866
For missions. But that's for cash, right?

1346
02:14:08.866 --> 02:14:10.866
If you would like to give cash, there are two white baskets here.

1347
02:14:11.866 --> 02:14:13.866
Bye bye. Have a nice Sunday. Happy Mother's Day.

1348
02:14:16.866 --> 02:14:19.866
Subtitles submitted by the Amara.org community
